"```python\nimport subprocess\n\ndef get_apache_version():\n    try:\n        output = subprocess.check_output(['apt-cache', 'policy', 'apache2']).decode('utf-8')\n        lines = output.split('\\n')\n        for line in lines:\n            if 'apache2' in line:\n                version = line.split(':')[1].split('(')[0].strip()\n                return version\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"An error occurred: {e}\")\n    return None\n\nprint(get_apache_version())\n```"
